WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:27.470 --> 01:31.410
Good morning...

01:31.980 --> 01:32.780
Good morning!

01:34.550 --> 01:35.750
Oh, Kato-san.

01:35.750 --> 01:36.720
Good morning!

01:36.720 --> 01:37.720
You look cheerful!

01:37.720 --> 01:38.280
Good morning!

01:39.850 --> 01:41.240
Don't I always?

01:41.550 --> 01:42.420
Chocolat...

01:42.420 --> 01:44.560
You're really hyper today.

01:44.560 --> 01:45.860
Did something good happen?

01:46.360 --> 01:47.190
Nothing much. I think that...

01:47.190 --> 01:51.660
all I need to do is
be myself and work hard.

01:51.660 --> 01:54.090
And I have Queen Candy
to thank for that.

01:54.090 --> 01:56.630
Not that I understand,
but is that how it is?

01:58.300 --> 01:59.300
Good morning!

02:00.170 --> 02:01.010
Good morning!

02:01.010 --> 02:03.440
Yo Kato, you're looking lively today.

02:03.440 --> 02:04.890
I'm loving that smile.

02:04.890 --> 02:07.110
Just seeing you like this
fills me with energy too!

02:11.510 --> 02:12.440
Hearts!

02:12.980 --> 02:14.120
Agrandissment!

02:14.820 --> 02:16.920
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

02:20.760 --> 02:26.230
Your hearts... Pick up!

02:35.340 --> 02:35.910
All right!

02:39.850 --> 02:44.250
Chocolat-chan's been able to get more
and more hearts these days.

02:45.620 --> 02:50.440
Don't be so worried, Vanilla-chama!
She's only getting lucky.

02:50.440 --> 02:51.860
It's not just luck.

02:51.860 --> 02:54.560
The number of hearts she's
getting really has gone up.

02:55.330 --> 02:57.290
She'll overtake me at this rate.

02:58.160 --> 02:59.780
I don't think that's possible.

02:59.780 --> 03:03.030
But if... But if
she does surpass me...

03:08.880 --> 03:12.470
Pierre's Temptation,
the Broken Friendship.

03:12.470 --> 03:14.450
Huh? Student Council President?

03:14.450 --> 03:16.510
That's right, Chocolat! Run for it!

03:17.080 --> 03:18.670
Why me?

03:19.080 --> 03:22.020
Every class has to
nominate a candidate,

03:22.020 --> 03:25.660
and there's no better choice
than you, Chocolat!

03:25.660 --> 03:29.730
Yeah! You have to get the school to relax
the rules and become more fun.

03:29.730 --> 03:33.060
So, you want me to become
Student Council President...

03:33.060 --> 03:35.200
and relax the school rules?

03:35.200 --> 03:39.700
That's right! You're the
only one who can do it.

03:42.010 --> 03:42.970
Really?

03:42.970 --> 03:43.950
Yeah, really!

03:44.340 --> 03:47.010
All right! I'll run in the election!

03:48.480 --> 03:50.520
We'll all support you!

03:50.520 --> 03:52.520
Let's start discussing strategies.

03:52.520 --> 03:53.250
Where?

03:53.250 --> 03:54.150
The cafeteria!

03:54.150 --> 03:56.150
Isn't that just your excuse to go there?

03:59.060 --> 04:01.990
There's something that's been
on my mind for awhile.

04:01.990 --> 04:03.330
What would that be?

04:03.830 --> 04:06.510
Why are you and Ice-san so close?

04:06.510 --> 04:09.600
Yeah, we've all been
wondering about that.

04:09.600 --> 04:11.730
After all, your personalities
are complete opposites.

04:11.730 --> 04:12.970
Why are we so close?

04:12.970 --> 04:15.910
Well... we've always been together,
ever since we were little kids.

04:15.910 --> 04:18.730
But I never thought about why.

04:18.730 --> 04:22.480
Childhood friends... that figures.

04:22.480 --> 04:24.750
What do you mean?
What are you getting at?

04:26.250 --> 04:30.860
The truth is... I don't know how
to get along with Ice-san.

04:30.860 --> 04:33.090
I'd always been giving her
the benefit of the doubt,

04:33.090 --> 04:35.760
since she's such a
good friend of yours, Kato-san.

04:35.760 --> 04:40.000
But I guess she only acts that
way to appeal to the boys.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.000
She's irritating.

04:44.970 --> 04:48.710
That's not true! Vanilla is just
doing very best she can!

04:49.210 --> 04:51.470
I won't let you talk bad about Vanilla.

04:52.610 --> 04:56.480
And once again, Chocolat's
greatest strength shows itself.

04:57.380 --> 04:59.620
Lots of girls gossip
behind others' backs,

04:59.620 --> 05:01.450
but Chocolat's not like them!

05:01.450 --> 05:03.460
Chocolat is so cool!

05:03.460 --> 05:05.660
Yeah, that's why she's our idol!

05:07.530 --> 05:08.960
I-I am?

05:13.410 --> 05:17.800
The truth is... I don't know how
to get along with Ice-san.

05:18.900 --> 05:21.420
I never imagined they saw me that way.

05:21.870 --> 05:25.040
People will say anything if it makes for juicy
gossip;

05:25.040 --> 05:27.010
People will say anything if it makes for juicy
gossip; pwease don't let it bother you.

05:31.950 --> 05:33.650
Ice-san, what happened?

05:34.990 --> 05:40.230
There's something we need your help with. Can you drop by our club sometime?

05:40.230 --> 05:43.800
You don't have to do anything
other than being there.

05:43.800 --> 05:45.130
Not this again...

05:45.130 --> 05:46.400
No kidding...

05:46.400 --> 05:48.230
Unbelievable!

05:50.660 --> 05:52.660
She only acts that way
to appeal to the boys.

05:53.740 --> 05:54.410
Ice-san!

05:57.380 --> 05:59.510
Did we offend her or something?

06:00.080 --> 06:03.150
Maybe she got scared because we
suddenly sprang this on her.

06:03.150 --> 06:05.150
Va... Vanilla-chama!

06:06.790 --> 06:09.650
Va... Vanilla-chama, pwease
don't abandon me!

06:09.650 --> 06:13.560
I'm only doing my best...
to become the Queen.

06:22.830 --> 06:23.770
Pierre...

06:25.500 --> 06:26.400
why are you here?

06:28.040 --> 06:32.120
Wait. You're better off staying here.

06:32.120 --> 06:34.830
This is the only place for you to be.

06:35.280 --> 06:37.820
Why do you think so?

06:37.820 --> 06:39.080
You seem so lonely.

06:39.080 --> 06:41.050
Lonely? Me?

06:41.050 --> 06:44.020
It's no surprise that
you feel that way.

06:44.020 --> 06:47.330
Les Royaumes pinned all their
hopes on Chocolat...

06:47.330 --> 06:49.060
and have totally
forgotten about you.

06:49.790 --> 06:51.060
No way...

06:51.500 --> 06:54.800
Do you know why they hold
the Queen Selection?

06:55.270 --> 06:56.330
"Why?"

06:56.330 --> 06:59.800
To choose the most suitable
Queen candidate.

07:00.270 --> 07:02.060
There's no need for it.

07:02.540 --> 07:05.070
Not when they've already
decided that Chocolat will be Queen.

07:06.410 --> 07:07.380
It's all a show.

07:07.380 --> 07:11.180
A festival designed to make the Queen
succession more interesting.

07:11.180 --> 07:12.720
No... you're lying!

07:13.320 --> 07:14.790
Why do you think I am lying?

07:14.790 --> 07:18.040
That's impossible.
Because Queen Candy...

07:18.040 --> 07:21.550
The same Queen who has such
high hopes for Chocolat?

07:21.550 --> 07:23.790
You are the Queen's daughter.

07:23.790 --> 07:26.860
But you're a princess who
can never be Queen.

07:27.570 --> 07:28.390
Stop!

07:28.970 --> 07:30.370
If it's really like this...

07:30.370 --> 07:33.370
Stop it...Stop it...
Don't say any more!

07:40.080 --> 07:42.150
The Queen Selection
can't be just a show.

07:42.150 --> 07:45.550
If it really is... then what have
I worked so hard for?

07:45.550 --> 07:47.140
I've even caused everyone to hate me.

07:47.850 --> 07:49.650
I have to find out from Mama.

07:53.360 --> 07:55.070
Is this okay?

07:55.460 --> 07:57.490
I have to ask Mama in person
to get an answer.

07:57.960 --> 08:00.370
What was that sound just now?

08:00.370 --> 08:03.230
Returning to the Magical World without permission may cause you to be disqualified!

08:03.230 --> 08:06.000
I may have been disqualified
from the very beginning.

08:06.440 --> 08:07.540
What does that mean?

08:11.080 --> 08:13.800
The Queen says she will
not be seeing you today.

08:13.800 --> 08:16.180
I must ask her something personally.

08:16.180 --> 08:19.060
It's something very important
about the Queen selection.

08:20.450 --> 08:21.770
This is troubling...

08:21.770 --> 08:24.990
No matter what, I won't move from this spot until I get to see the Queen!

08:29.730 --> 08:31.280
What's this about?

08:31.280 --> 08:33.730
There's something
I have to ask you, Mama.

08:35.130 --> 08:37.940
Vanilla, you are a Queen candidate.

08:37.940 --> 08:40.510
Even though you're my daughter,
a test is still a test.

08:40.510 --> 08:45.500
As you have returned to the Magical World without permission, you will be disqualified.

08:45.940 --> 08:48.010
Am I really a Queen candidate?

08:48.010 --> 08:51.630
Wasn't it decided from the start that
Chocolat-chan will become Queen?

08:52.820 --> 08:54.590
What are you saying?

08:54.590 --> 08:56.920
The Queen Selection
is just a show!

08:56.920 --> 09:01.090
I heard that Chocolat-chan had already
been chosen as the next Queen!

09:01.090 --> 09:02.190
Who said that?

09:05.160 --> 09:06.100
Pierre.

09:06.500 --> 09:09.360
By "Pierre," you mean
that Ogre boy, correct?

09:12.640 --> 09:13.360
That's right.

09:13.360 --> 09:17.870
Vanilla-sama, were you not aware
that he is also the Ogre Prince?

09:19.340 --> 09:20.280
Of course I was aware of that.

09:20.280 --> 09:23.040
He tricked you, Vanilla.

09:23.040 --> 09:23.750
But...

09:23.750 --> 09:27.090
Normally, you would
be disqualified for this.

09:27.090 --> 09:32.490
But since it's the result of an Ogre
conspiracy, I will not pursue the matter.

09:32.490 --> 09:36.590
However, I am not doing this because
you are my daughter.

09:36.590 --> 09:40.690
Even if Chocolat had done the same thing,
my judgment would not have differed.

09:41.470 --> 09:45.740
But on this matter, you knew you were
dealing with the Ogre Prince.

09:45.740 --> 09:51.010
Yet you let him bait you into doing
something unbefitting a Queen candidate.

09:51.010 --> 09:53.210
So as your punishment, you will
receive a deduction in points.

09:57.220 --> 09:57.880
I'm back.

10:08.160 --> 10:11.930
I'm your candidate for the Student Council
presidential election, Chocolat Kato!

10:11.930 --> 10:13.700
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

10:13.700 --> 10:17.100
I request the addition of a fried
rice combo to the menu!

10:17.100 --> 10:20.050
Institute a uniforms-only dress code!

10:20.050 --> 10:21.840
Okay, leave it to me!

10:24.580 --> 10:26.440
No, no... It's impossible.

10:48.370 --> 10:49.620
Vanilla-chama...

10:50.740 --> 10:54.940
Blanca, if Chocolat-chan really became
Student Council President,

10:54.940 --> 10:57.840
she'd be able to get
even more hearts, right?

10:58.540 --> 11:03.600
Definitely not! No matter what, you'll
always be the best, Vanilla-chama!

11:08.120 --> 11:10.590
Vanilla-chama, how about some tea?

11:10.590 --> 11:14.320
No, I'm not in the mood.

11:15.290 --> 11:17.800
But a lovely scent
will improve your mood!

11:17.800 --> 11:22.200
Ah yes, there's a new
rose tea in the kitchen.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.270
I'm off to get it.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.290
Pierre?

11:44.320 --> 11:48.490
Vanilla, you really do have
a lonely look on your face.

11:48.490 --> 11:52.310
And no one can comprehend
what's inside your heart.

11:53.460 --> 11:55.230
Pierre, I...

12:08.250 --> 12:10.380
Vanilla-chama,
sorry to keep you waiting!

12:16.550 --> 12:17.620
Vanilla-chama...

12:38.610 --> 12:40.230
How pretty.

12:41.050 --> 12:43.810
I know you like pretty things.

12:44.680 --> 12:46.920
Anything's good if it holds
your attention, right?

12:46.920 --> 12:48.450
You prepared this for me?

12:48.450 --> 12:51.490
Yeah. Look, this is sugar candy.

12:51.490 --> 12:54.710
Sweet, lovely, and adorable...

12:55.190 --> 12:56.860
But easily crushed.

12:56.860 --> 12:58.200
Much like your heart.

12:59.100 --> 13:01.300
Thus it must be stored
inside this glass bottle...

13:02.330 --> 13:04.370
so that no one can break it.

13:06.300 --> 13:07.430
Pierre...

13:07.870 --> 13:11.200
We're both owners of a lonely heart.

13:11.680 --> 13:12.740
Maybe we are.

13:13.850 --> 13:18.750
You're probably the only one in
this world that understands me.

13:20.220 --> 13:21.180
But why?

13:21.920 --> 13:22.440
Why what?

13:22.890 --> 13:27.660
Why did you lie and say Chocolat-chan
was already chosen as the next Queen?

13:27.660 --> 13:31.200
Isn't it true that everyone has
high hopes for Chocolat?

13:31.530 --> 13:31.960
Yes...

13:34.130 --> 13:35.900
Yeah... they certainly do.

13:37.300 --> 13:39.000
I have a suggestion for you.

13:39.000 --> 13:39.640
A suggestion?

13:39.640 --> 13:42.670
Have you ever thought of running
for Student Council President?

13:42.670 --> 13:45.130
Student Council President? Me?

13:45.540 --> 13:48.670
We cannot let Chocolat do
whatever she wants anymore.

13:54.060 --> 13:55.090
Waaah!

13:55.090 --> 13:57.020
I'm gonna be late!

13:57.020 --> 13:59.560
Vanilla, why didn't you wake me up?!?

13:59.920 --> 14:00.890
Huh?

14:00.890 --> 14:03.530
Did Vanilla already leave for school?

14:03.860 --> 14:08.170
Without Vanilla, I'm totally helpless!

14:08.730 --> 14:10.430
You finally realized that?

14:10.430 --> 14:11.270
Shut up.

14:17.340 --> 14:19.680
Any later than this and you'll be tardy.

14:19.680 --> 14:20.780
What do you want?

14:21.380 --> 14:23.800
Actually, I have something to tell you.

14:24.350 --> 14:27.300
I'm sure it won't be anything good.
Plus, I'm in a hurry.

14:27.690 --> 14:31.920
Vanilla Ice has decided to participate in the
Student Council presidential election.

14:33.520 --> 14:35.520
How can that be?

14:35.860 --> 14:37.730
Ice-san is a candidate?

14:37.730 --> 14:40.560
Recommended by the Middle
School Student Council?

14:41.130 --> 14:42.770
That's right.

14:42.770 --> 14:47.610
Vanilla Ice-san is the Middle School Student Council's recommended candidate.

14:47.610 --> 14:50.300
So the others don't
even compare to her.

14:50.710 --> 14:56.610
The Members will hold a tea party this
afternoon. Please be there, everyone.

14:56.610 --> 14:59.780
We will discuss Ice-san's
qualifications and abilities.

15:01.590 --> 15:02.990
Ice-san!

15:04.460 --> 15:06.760
Ice-san, how are you?

15:06.760 --> 15:08.550
We were searching for you.

15:08.860 --> 15:11.030
Will you come to the tea party today?

15:11.860 --> 15:14.330
I... I... today?

15:14.830 --> 15:17.800
What, now she's cozying up
to the Members?

15:17.800 --> 15:19.560
She makes me sick.

15:19.560 --> 15:23.370
Nobody ever knows what's going
on inside Ice-san's brain.

15:23.370 --> 15:27.580
Even though you're childhood friends,
you'd better be careful, Kato-san.

15:28.180 --> 15:29.570
That's not it...

15:29.570 --> 15:32.080
There's got to be
some other reason for this!

15:36.620 --> 15:38.720
What happened, Vanilla?

15:43.060 --> 15:47.060
Ice-san is gentle on the outside,
but strong on the inside.

15:47.060 --> 15:53.270
Kato-san is very energetic and active,
but she lacks leadership skills.

15:53.270 --> 15:56.610
Therefore, Ice-san
has our full support.

15:57.140 --> 16:01.810
To become a leader, one must be
sensitive to others' feelings.

16:07.950 --> 16:12.290
We will now hear speeches
from the candidates.

16:12.290 --> 16:13.660
Vanilla Ice-san.

16:13.660 --> 16:15.130
Y-yes!

16:19.430 --> 16:21.230
What could've happened to Vanilla?

16:21.230 --> 16:24.260
Why didn't she talk to me about this?

16:27.770 --> 16:34.750
I'm Vanilla Ice, a candidate for
Student Council President.

16:34.750 --> 16:37.880
I know that my strengths are limited,

16:37.880 --> 16:43.820
but I hope to serve the student body
by making everyone happy.

16:44.420 --> 16:47.360
That's what...

16:48.160 --> 16:49.160
Keep it up!

16:51.360 --> 16:54.200
That's what I... stand for.

16:54.500 --> 16:57.800
I hope everyone will support me!

16:57.800 --> 17:01.070
I hope everyone will give
me a serving chance–

17:01.070 --> 17:02.970
a chance to serve you.

17:02.970 --> 17:05.120
She's so cute!

17:07.040 --> 17:09.450
Next is Chocolat Kato-san.

17:10.750 --> 17:13.120
Kato-san, Kato-san?

17:12.520 --> 17:14.190
Chocolat! Earth to Chocolat!

17:14.190 --> 17:15.590
They're calling for you!

17:15.590 --> 17:17.120
Huh? Okay!

17:21.860 --> 17:26.230
Umm... I, Chocolat Kato, promise
the following in my campaign:

17:26.230 --> 17:29.470
One: to lift all
oppressive school rules.

17:29.470 --> 17:32.200
Two: to hold more fun events.

17:32.200 --> 17:34.370
Third: to abolish tests!

17:34.370 --> 17:36.140
That is all! Thanks!

17:36.140 --> 17:37.700
Applaud me!

17:42.430 --> 17:43.310
Something wrong?

17:43.960 --> 17:45.410
Something's... wrong.

17:45.410 --> 17:46.750
This is not good...

17:46.750 --> 17:47.920
She went too far...

17:47.920 --> 17:50.170
The future looks bleak.

17:51.190 --> 17:52.880
Man, that was harder than I thought.

17:59.530 --> 18:00.730
I'm full!

18:01.170 --> 18:02.630
I'm full.

18:08.470 --> 18:09.810
Say, Vanilla?

18:10.640 --> 18:11.360
What?

18:11.810 --> 18:14.740
Why are you running for Student
Council President?

18:16.050 --> 18:18.610
Well, why are you running?

18:18.610 --> 18:24.590
Me? I just couldn't say no to Akane and
the others when they asked me.

18:26.360 --> 18:29.330
I'm running because
Pierre suggested it.

18:31.730 --> 18:33.380
Because of Pierre? Why?

18:33.380 --> 18:36.090
Pierre says I'm better for the job.

18:36.090 --> 18:39.840
Vanilla... since when are
you so close to Pierre?

18:39.840 --> 18:42.810
Should I have consulted you first?

18:42.810 --> 18:49.050
But you kept telling me to stay away
from him because he's an Ogre!

18:49.050 --> 18:51.210
Yea, I said that before,

18:53.650 --> 18:55.400
but I realized I was wrong.

18:55.400 --> 18:56.490
Wrong about what?

18:56.490 --> 18:58.630
Even if I told you, you wouldn't
understand, Chocolat-chan.

19:00.120 --> 19:03.030
You've always got
someone by your side.

19:03.030 --> 19:06.620
Somebody who's loved by all
could never understand it!

19:15.640 --> 19:18.340
Ice-san, Kato-san...

19:19.080 --> 19:21.950
Ice-san, Ice-san...

19:22.580 --> 19:28.390
Kato-san, Ice-san, Ice-san.

19:29.020 --> 19:32.960
Vanilla Ice is elected as the next
Student Council President.

19:38.630 --> 19:40.900
Thanks to all those
who have supported me.

19:42.170 --> 19:44.540
I totally screwed up that speech...

19:44.540 --> 19:48.870
Vanilla would have been elected,
no matter how hard you tried.

19:50.170 --> 19:52.670
Do you think that there
is anything I can't do?

19:52.670 --> 19:53.920
What do you mean by that?

20:02.690 --> 20:05.990
Do you think Pierre rigged the election?

20:05.990 --> 20:06.860
It can't be!

20:11.060 --> 20:12.300
It can't be...

20:28.110 --> 20:30.010
Vanilla, is it true?

20:30.980 --> 20:33.320
Is what true, Chocolat-chan?

20:33.320 --> 20:36.590
Did you use Pierre's influence
to win the election?

20:36.590 --> 20:39.160
To win the election? Yes.

20:39.160 --> 20:41.690
I ran because of
Pierre's recommendation.

20:41.690 --> 20:43.460
That's not what I mean!

20:44.460 --> 20:46.090
Then what do you mean?

20:48.600 --> 20:51.350
Did you use Pierre's Ogre magic?

20:55.070 --> 20:56.470
Do you really think I would?

20:56.470 --> 20:59.010
I'm mistaken, right?
It isn't true, is it?

21:01.480 --> 21:02.530
Tell me I'm wrong!

21:06.350 --> 21:07.320
Let go of me.

21:10.990 --> 21:11.790
Vanilla...

21:13.420 --> 21:17.790
That's so cruel of you
to accuse me like that.

21:18.790 --> 21:21.590
Vanilla, don't get any closer to Pierre.

21:22.590 --> 21:25.070
You've been acting strange recently.

21:26.070 --> 21:27.340
Leave me alone!

21:30.070 --> 21:31.440
Vanilla...

21:31.780 --> 21:35.110
Pierre's the only one
who understands me!

21:40.950 --> 21:46.110
Chocolat-chan... I'm sorry.

21:49.620 --> 21:51.120
But I will never let you...

21:52.500 --> 21:54.400
have the Queen's throne.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:47.510 --> 23:51.240
Aww, I got in another
fight with Vanilla.

23:52.600 --> 23:55.630
But it's all right,
we'll make up really soon.

23:56.700 --> 24:00.450
No matter what happens,
we'll always be best friends.

24:01.960 --> 24:04.180
Wasn't that what we promised, Vanilla?

24:05.300 --> 24:07.500
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.500 --> 24:09.840
Birth of the Ogre Queen.

24:11.030 --> 24:13.710
Vanilla, what do you mean by "farewell"?
